    </div>
    <h3 class="font-montserrat text-[24px] font-semibold leading-[28.8px]" style="color: #2A2A2A;">From Foresight to Execution</h3>
    <p class="font-merriweather text-[17px] font-normal leading-[29px] max-w-[700px] mx-auto mt-5 text-left" style="color: #2A2A2A;">
      Our tailored methodologies accelerate your digital and strategic transformation. Explore our areas of expertise below.
